1 REM === t53_delay.bpp ===
2 REM Tests: PAUSE, DELAY, SLEEP (minimal values)
3 DIALECT "GWBS"
10 TEST "DELAY"
20 DELAY 1
30 REM 1ms delay, just verify no crash
40 ENDTEST
100 TEST "PAUSE"
110 PAUSE 1
120 REM 1 tick delay
130 ENDTEST
200 TEST "SLEEP"
210 SLEEP 0
220 REM 0 second sleep
230 ENDTEST
999 END
